        "sid": "EXO 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Ekapolon neni a Moses, “Kiira, ekesikokini ayoŋ iyoŋ irworo Akuj aneni a Parao, ido eruwor lokaato kon Aron irwori aŋuna kon ikwa ekadwaran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Irwori iyoŋ ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna ekecikak ayoŋ iyoŋ, ikotere lokaato kon Aron elimokini Parao kimyek Ŋisirael toloto anakwap a Ijipit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai eturuwori ayoŋ iŋes ŋolo egogoŋ akou, ido etiyakini ayoŋ ŋakujuwuanisya ka ŋaumonokineta ŋuna alalak nakwap a Ijipit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani pa kiira Parao ŋakiro kon, atiŋi ayoŋ Ijipit neni aronon, ido oyau Ŋisirael ŋituŋa kaŋ a nen a ŋatukon esibit ajore, tolomut anakwap Ijipit anapedor kaŋ a ŋina apolon, a ŋina esicania Ijipit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyenunete Ŋijipitian atemar arae ayoŋ Ekapolon apaki ŋina esicania ayoŋ ŋituŋa a Ijipit, ido oyau Ŋisirael a nen anakwap a Ijipit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu Moses ka Aron kitiyata ŋuna ecikit Akuj ikes akitiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru a Moses ŋatomonikanikauni ka arae ŋikaru ka Aron ŋatomonikanikauni ka ŋiuni apaki ŋina esirworyata ikes Parao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebela ŋolo ka Aron",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Ekapolon neni a Moses ka Aron, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ani etemari Parao neni kus, ‘Kitiyakisi aumokinet adio,’ emaikina nai iyoŋ Moses tolimok Aron ebe, ‘Tolemu ebela kon kimasak kwap kiŋaren a Parao, ido ilocokin ebela ŋol eruwor emun. ’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu Moses ka Aron toloto neni a Parao, kitiyata ikwapei ecikitor Ekapolon ikes; abu Aron kimasak ebela keŋ kwap kiŋaren a Parao ka ŋulu apolok anapukan keŋ, ido abu ebela ŋol kilocokin toruwor emun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a ŋun, abu Parao tonyarau ŋikaosok ka ŋikekukujak, ido apotu ŋikekukujak a Ijipit daŋ kitiyata ŋakujuwuanisya ŋuna pei ŋun aloticisyo kec a ŋulu pa apatana ayenun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ŋinituŋanan alotooma kec kimasak ebela keŋ kwap, ido apotu toruworos ŋimuno, nai abu ŋolo ka Aron kiliko ŋulu kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari ŋina aponiata ŋakiro kikokis nen, abu Parao kitogogoŋ akou keŋ, nyepupok ŋakiro ata Moses, lopite ŋolo alimokinitor Ekapolon ikes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akisicanet ŋina esyaunan: Toruworos ŋakipi ŋaokot",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Ekapolon tema neni a Moses, “Etogogoŋ Parao akou keŋ; ewounit akimyekin Ŋisirael toloto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ape neni a Parao moi eriŋa ataparacu, apaki ŋina elomarya iŋes kiŋa nakipi; a aŋolol Nile; emaikina iyoŋ towo alokipetot ka aŋolol Nile kiryamunos ka iŋes nen ka emaikina iyoŋ totiŋ ebela kon ŋolo abu kilocokin toruwor emun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema iyoŋ neni keŋ, ‘ekeyakuu ayoŋ Ekapolon Akuj a Ŋiburaniyae neni kon alimokin iyoŋ atemar kimyek ŋituŋa kaŋ toloto, ikotere ilipete neni kaŋ analoŋisat nai tari tokona iwou iyoŋ akiirar ŋakiro ŋun.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋakiro ŋuna irworo Ekapolon ikes nu: Iyenuni iyoŋ atemar erae iŋes Ekapolon anakiro a nu; kiŋolik, arami ayoŋ ŋakipi a Nile a ebela alo a ŋolo atiŋit, ido eruwor ŋakipi ŋaokot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etwakete ŋikolya anaŋolol daadaŋ, ido ebosuni aŋolol tul, nyepedorete Ŋijipitian akimat ŋakipi a Nile nabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Ekapolon neni a Moses, “Tolimok Aron ebe, ‘Ya ebela kon toramya ŋakipi ŋuna eya Ijipit: Ŋakipi a ŋaŋololin, ŋakipi a ŋakitelesyo, ŋakipi a ŋataparin ka ŋuna a ŋakare daadaŋ, ikotere ŋakipi ŋun daadaŋ toruwor ŋaokot. Epete ŋaokot neni eya ŋakipi anakwap a Ijipit daadaŋ, epete tari loboro ŋulu itiyaunitae a ŋakito ka a ŋamoru.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Moses ka Aron kitiyata ŋun lopite ŋolo ecikitor ikes Ekapolon. Abu Aron kikyaa ebela keŋ alokiŋaren Parao ka ŋulu apolok anapukan keŋ, toram ŋakipi a aŋolol Nile, ido apotu ŋakipi daadaŋ anaŋolol toruworos ŋaokot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totwaka ŋikolya anaŋolol. Tobosut ŋakipi anaŋolol tul, todaun Ŋijipitian epite ŋolomaset ŋakipi ŋun. Apotu ŋaokot toyakaun nakwap a Ijipit daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai apotu ŋikekukujak a Ijipit daŋ kitiyata ŋakujuwuanisya ŋunapei ŋun aloticisyo kec a ŋulu pa apatana ayenun. Aŋun, abu Parao kitogogoŋ akou keŋ nyepupok ŋakiro ata Moses, lopite ŋolo alimokinitor Ekapolon ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Parao toboŋo a nen, tolot kai keŋ, ido abu nyemitak tari ŋakiro ŋun daŋ alotau keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai Ŋijipitian daadaŋ toboka ŋakare nawaetin a aŋolol Nile aŋuna ka aryamunia ŋakipi ŋunamatan, anerae pa apedorito ikes akimat ŋakipi ŋuna aya naŋolol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋirwa ŋikanikaarei tolunyar akisyakin anakoloŋit a ŋina eturuworia Ekapolon ŋakipi a Nile ŋaokot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
